      <title>2026 Q2量产启动！特斯拉Cybercab：无人驾驶出租车市场的新纪元与颠覆式制造密码</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251107-2026-q2%E9%87%8F%E4%BA%A7%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89cybercab%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E5%87%BA%E7%A7%9F%E8%BD%A6%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B0%E7%BA%AA%E5%85%83%E4%B8%8E%E9%A2%A0%E8%A6%86%E5%BC%8F%E5%88%B6%E9%80%A0%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81/</link>
